MomentsOut.description:
Step 4, the Student's own moments (Story 9.7, FR-44, UX-DR31), from the facts set stored
for them (AD-7). With fewer than 10 own Orders the game was played mostly by AI players:
`mostly_ai`, no heading and no moments; the rest of the Debrief stays open.

ReportReplayOut.description:
The Student's Replay (FR-58, FR-50): `finished`, `closed` at the Test deadline, or `open`;
the Role, the scenario and the run; for a finished one the Class game it is set beside (null
when it was played mostly by AI players, `mostly_ai`, or cannot be read).

post.description:
Ask for lecturer access from the Landing (Story 3.13). Stores the request for the Admin;
no account and no Invitation is created. The answer is the same `202` whether or not the
address has an account.

«Ferdig med steget» (Story 9.11, FR-43): a joined Student has finished shared step 2 or 3;
once every joined Student has, the step pointer moves on for all. 403
`explanation_required` before the Explanation, `forbidden` for a Student who has not joined;
409 `not_group` on a Personal debrief, `step_not_open` for a step after the pointer's.
